  unitName: "Dhaos (5\u2605)"
  unitId: 50844
  unitNumber: 1130
  description: The Demon King who spread fear in another world. Dhaos led the demons
    under his command to attack Midgards, initiating the great war known as the Valhalla
    War. The powerful Mana Cannon that would come to be used in this war would spell
    the downfall of Dhaos, but he somehow managed to escape through space and time
    afterwards. Legend has it that he cannot be harmed by any other means besides
    magic.
  summonDesc: If you mean to get in my way,<br>then your only fate is destruction!
  fusionDesc: How long must I wait for the Great Seed...?
